FILE: app.py
PURPOSE: FastAPI application; all HTTP API endpoints.
IMPORTS: fastapi, chromadb, session, config, dto_models, search, pdf_handler, metadata, file_loader

ENDPOINTS:
  GET  /api/health                      → 200 OK liveness check
  POST /api/chat                        → ChatRequest → SearchResult via search()
  GET  /api/download/{filename}         → FileResponse from UPLOAD_DIR
  POST /api/upload                      → UploadFile → UploadResponse; loads DataFrame, generates metadata, stores in ChromaDB
  GET  /api/smart-parser/questions      → Returns SmartParserQuestion list for active session
  POST /api/smart-parser/answers        → Accepts SmartParserAnswersRequest; regenerates metadata with user answers

KEY GLOBALS:
  _chroma_client   PersistentClient at ./vector_db
  session_manager  SessionManager singleton

NOTES:
  - CORS allows http://localhost:5173 (Vite dev server)
  - Upload detects file type (excel/csv/pdf) and sets session.current_mode accordingly
  - Smart Parser flow: upload → GET questions → POST answers → metadata regenerated with richer context
